@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam ArrowColor #475569
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam componentStyle uml2
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam maxMessageSize 65
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFF8DD
skinparam noteBorderColor #D6B65C
skinparam classBackgroundColor #EFF6FF
skinparam componentBackgroundColor #EFF6FF
skinparam stateBackgroundColor #EFF6FF
title 建议：准备阶段与播放意图分开（状态图）
state "无选曲" as Empty
state "准备中 / 安静等待" as Preparing
state "就绪且暂停" as Paused
state "正在播放" as Playing
state "定位中" as Seeking
state "缓冲等待" as Buffering
state "失败停留" as Failed
state "自然结束停留" as Ended
[*] --> Empty
Empty --> Preparing : 加入第一首 / intent=Pause
Preparing --> Preparing : 换曲 / 新 epoch
Preparing --> Preparing : 暂停 / intent=Pause，允许准备继续
Preparing --> Playing : Prepared [intent=Play] / 开始
Preparing --> Paused : Prepared [intent=Pause]
Paused --> Playing : Play / 短渐入
Playing --> Paused : Pause / 短渐出
Playing --> Preparing : 手动换曲 / 旧曲短渐出后停
Paused --> Preparing : 选中另一首 / 保留 Pause
Playing --> Seeking : Seek / 新 seekId
Paused --> Seeking : Seek / 保留 Pause
Seeking --> Playing : SeekSettled [intent=Play]
Seeking --> Paused : SeekSettled [intent=Pause]
Seeking --> Seeking : Pause / intent=Pause
Playing --> Buffering : 可播放数据耗尽
Buffering --> Playing : 补齐 [intent=Play]
Buffering --> Paused : Pause / 就绪后不自动播放
Playing --> Ended : 自然结束 [顺序末尾或播放完成暂停]
Playing --> Preparing : 自然下一首未就绪 / 保持 Play
Playing --> Playing : 已授权下一首无缝接管 / 更新身份
Preparing --> Failed : 失败 [暂停意图或单曲循环或遍历耗尽]
Buffering --> Failed : 明确失败 [不能自动跳过]
Playing --> Failed : 播放失败 [不能自动跳过]
Preparing --> Preparing : 失败 [允许跳过] / 策略选择未尝试项
Failed --> Preparing : Play / 重试当前，新失败轮次
Ended --> Preparing : Play / 当前曲从头
note bottom of Empty
全局规则：清空队列 -> 无选曲并清除播放意图；
手动选曲可打断等待、定位和失败；迟到事件按票据丢弃。
图展示主要路径，完整判断以需求记录和状态转移测试为准。
end note

@enduml
